OL,3,GNEWSACafe manager wins first World
OL,4,AShortbread Championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe manager from Gairloch has won
OL,7,Fthe top prize in the first World
OL,8,FShortbread Championship.
OL,10,FThe event, organised by High Life
OL,11,FHighland, was held in Inverness at the
OL,12,Fweekend.
OL,14,FBakers from around the globe including
OL,15,Ffrom the USA and France travelled to
OL,16,Fthe Highland capital to compete.
OL,18,FNoreen Mackenzie, from Gairloch
OL,19,FMuseum's Am BC rd Cafe, took home the
OL,20,Ftrophy by "not over-complicating
OL,21,Fthings" with her traditional recipe.
